// Game: Generic
// Format: Standard
// area-lights-demo: the area-light Scripting-surface example. A sealed
// 512 x 256 x 128 room lit by two ceiling light_area skylights tagged
// `skylight`, neither with an `_animated` key; the data script pulses both
// from load, which reserves their animated bake. A dim `_bake_only` point
// light in the south-west corner is the map's one static light: without one
// the compiler bakes no lightmap and the room draws a flat white placeholder
// under the pulse. The east panel still carries
// keys left from a `light_spot` it was converted from (`delay`,
// `_light_size`, `_cone`, `mangle`): each warns at build and is ignored.
// See: content/dev/maps/area-lights-demo.README.md
